5,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. Let's try to find the werewolf together and be honest with each other.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is so exciting! I'm going to find the bad guy first!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I bet I can spot the werewolf just by looking at them!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's not be too hasty. Logic and observation are what will win this game.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A balanced approach is best. I look forward to seeing how your theories develop.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they'd like to share?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,I think we should all just talk a lot! That's how you find the lies!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,Yeah! Let's make it a big party of guessing!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Talking too much often leads to noise, not information. I'll be watching for inconsistencies.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion is correct, though a bit cold. I'll be analyzing the patterns of our speech.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with Benjamin. Let's keep a close eye on how we all interact.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,@Midori is so nice! I trust her!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I trust everyone... for now! Hehe!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,Trust is a luxury we cannot afford in this game.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Let us see who tries too hard to appear innocent.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
