31,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Everyone, I have some very important information. I am the Seer, and I found the werewolf. It's Sakura.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,What?! Sakura is the werewolf? No way!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Huh?! Midori-san, that's a lie! I'm just a normal girl! Why would you say that?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A bold claim right at the start. Either Midori is the Seer, or she's a werewolf trying to frame Sakura.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"This is a dramatic opening. @Midori, are you certain of your result?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I am certain. I divined Sakura last night, and the result was werewolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,But Sakura is so funny! Maybe the Seer made a mistake?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"See! Rin believes me! Midori-san, you're being mean! I'm definitely human!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, emotion is not evidence. If Midori is the Seer, the game ends today.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"If Midori were the werewolf, claiming the Seer role this early is a high-risk strategy.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm not lying. Please, for the sake of the village, we must vote for Sakura.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I don't know... but if Midori-san says so, maybe she's right?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm not the werewolf! Please don't vote for me! I'll be so sad!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,The logic leans toward Midori. A werewolf wouldn't usually reveal themselves as the Seer on day one unless desperate.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. The probability that Midori is the Seer is higher than her being a werewolf lying about a divination.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Midori,,Thank you for trusting me.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Okay, I'll believe Midori-san!","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,This is so unfair! You're all meanies!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shion,,It's not about being mean; it's about the most likely truth.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am convinced. Let us proceed to the vote.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
